[{"source":"steam","title":"Mind the Birds!","pub_date":"2026-10-06T20:59:54Z","link":"https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/1422450/view/703281025618282871","guid":{"is_perma_link":true,"text":"https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/1422450/view/703281025618282871"},"content":"<img src=\"https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/45164767/720ba4e0f1b1ed105708f7b15cdfc7ad95bfdb30/english.png\" data-fallback-src=\"https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/45164767/720ba4e0f1b1ed105708f7b15cdfc7ad95bfdb30.png\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; this.src=this.dataset.fallbackSrc;\"><br><br>It was a close contest, but today we find New York's notorious pigeon lady leaving her favorite perch in Central Park and joining the fight on the city streets. <br><br>Tourists in the park might not think much of ol' Baba sitting on her bench - sipping tea and talking to her birds - but the locals have always suspected that something more brews below the surface. In the heat of battle, Baba "},{"source":"steam","title":" Minor Update - 10-05-2026","pub_date":"2026-10-05T23:05:32Z","link":"https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/1422450/view/703281025618282632","guid":{"is_perma_link":true,"text":"https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/1422450/view/703281025618282632"},"content":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Fixed bugs that were causing troopers to walk too slowly in lane</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Rat King: Scrap Grenade - Fixed some bugs with bouncing targeting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Rat King: Scrap Grenade - Damage increased from 65 to 70</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Rat King: Scrap Grenade - T2 Damage increased from 65 to 70</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Rat King: Rat Swarm - Base Cooldown reduced from 28s to 24s</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Rat King: Rule, Ratannia! - Cooldown increased from 130 to 160</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Rat King: Rule, Ratannia! - Damage Reduction reduced from 20% to 15%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Rat"},{"source":"forum","title":"09-29-2026","pub_date":"2026-10-05T23:00:12Z","link":"https://forums.playdeadlock.com/threads/09-29-2026.166726/","guid":{"is_perma_link":false,"text":"urn:xenforo:thread:166726"},"category":{"domain":"https://forums.playdeadlock.com/forums/changelog.10/","text":"Changelog"},"content":"<div class=\"bbWrapper\"><div class=\"bbCodeBlock bbCodeBlock--unfurl    js-unfurl fauxBlockLink\"\n\t\tdata-unfurl=\"true\" data-result-id=\"11817\" data-result-token=\"1791505934:8be863ad13dd1b3b06bf0caff311196d82ba17e4a615fc29260590dc32d6c021\" data-url=\"https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/1422450/view/694273194214819790\" data-host=\"store.steampowered.com\" data-pending=\"false\">\n\t\t<div class=\"contentRow\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"contentRow-figure contentRow-figure--fixedSmall js-unfurl-figure\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://clan.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/45164767/58160deebbd1c61d525f4e516690161858d1e95f.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"store.steampowered.com\" class=\"bbCodeBlockUnfurl-image\" data-onerror=\"h"},{"source":"steam","title":"Listen up, Crumbums! Your King is here.","pub_date":"2026-10-02T20:59:51Z","link":"https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/1422450/view/703281025618281704","guid":{"is_perma_link":true,"text":"https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/1422450/view/703281025618281704"},"content":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img src=\"https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/45164767/40a0a47432b4e8c857d40152295f1551702c1012/english.png\" data-fallback-src=\"https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/45164767/40a0a47432b4e8c857d40152295f1551702c1012.png\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; this.src=this.dataset.fallbackSrc;\"><br>Out of the sewers and into the streets, the rightful King of the Rats is here at last. Rodent-hating citizens of Manhattan won't be prepared to see his <i>Scrap Grenade</i> bouncing down Broadway, nor for his <i>Swarm of Rats</i> biting at their heels. By donning his <i>Royal Pestments</i>, the Rat King shakes off incoming damage, allowing him to bravely lead the charge in"},{"source":"steam","title":"City Never Sleeps","pub_date":"2026-09-29T20:25:11Z","link":"https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/1422450/view/694273194214819790","guid":{"is_perma_link":true,"text":"https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/1422450/view/694273194214819790"},"content":"<a class=\"bb_link\" href=\"https://steamcommunity.com/linkfilter/?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.playdeadlock.com%2Fcityneversleeps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\" noopener\" ><img src=\"https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/45164767/4cb96ab54e327aefdcfeef87a67414bdf8f03c6f/english.png\" data-fallback-src=\"https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/45164767/4cb96ab54e327aefdcfeef87a67414bdf8f03c6f.png\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; this.src=this.dataset.fallbackSrc;\"></a><br><br>The Cursed Apple is ever changing, and these streets are nothing like you remember. A massive visual update to the map and neutrals, six new heroes, HUD updates, numerous quality-of-life additions, accessibility options, and more.<br><br>"},{"source":"forum","title":"09-16-2026 Update","pub_date":"2026-09-16T22:41:46Z","link":"https://forums.playdeadlock.com/threads/09-16-2026-update.162572/","guid":{"is_perma_link":false,"text":"urn:xenforo:thread:162572"},"category":{"domain":"https://forums.playdeadlock.com/forums/changelog.10/","text":"Changelog"},"content":"<div class=\"bbWrapper\"><div class=\"bbCodeBlock bbCodeBlock--unfurl    js-unfurl fauxBlockLink\"\n\t\tdata-unfurl=\"true\" data-result-id=\"11569\" data-result-token=\"1791505934:a826240e5550255809ee83ba9ce7a4ca1dcfde719fecd08ac7dccd98fc863dba\" data-url=\"https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/1422450/view/698776157349216434\" data-host=\"store.steampowered.com\" data-pending=\"false\">\n\t\t<div class=\"contentRow\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"contentRow-figure contentRow-figure--fixedSmall js-unfurl-figure\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://clan.akama